  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Ego Guido de Salimbenis, spontanea voluntate et bona fide, manumitto et liberum facio Ioannem servum meum, filium quondam Martini, ab omni iugo servitutis et conditione servili, ita ut de cetero sit liber et franchus et possit ire, stare, morari et facere quidquid voluerit sicut ceteri homines liberi et franchi.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si quis contra hanc meam cartam libertatis venire temptaverit, componat auri optimi libras quinquaginta, dimidia pars camerae communis Senarum et dimidia pars ipsi Ioanni liberato.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness><name>Iacobus de Tolomeis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Ugolinus de Piccolominis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Rolandus de Berardenga</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Farinata de Malavoltis</name></witness>
      </listWitness>
    </body>
  </text>
